To automate the process of deploying a Swift app to a remote server using PHP, you can use a combination of command-line tools and PHP functions. Here's a sample PHP code that demonstrates how this deployment process could work:
```php
<?php
// Define the remote server information
$server = 'example.com';
$username = 'remote_username';
$password = 'remote_password';
$remote_dir = '/var/www/html';
// Define the local app directory
